// Personality knobs. _ds deciseconds, _tiles tiles, _permille per mille.
// Schema: crates/rules/src/ai.rs (deny_unknown_fields). M5b shipped
// `standard`; M6 adds rush, boom and tower (the `random` pool) and the
// knobs after `random` in every row (docs/design/ai.md, "Personalities").
(
  personalities: [
    (
      id: "standard", name: "Standard", build_order: "standard",
      think_every_ds: 5, lookahead: 3, max_commands_per_think: 16,
      site_checks_per_think: 4, rebalance_per_think: 2, blocked_retry_ds: 300,
